<title>RUSSIA: Russian 1996 oil output fell 2.0 pct to 293 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russian 1996 oil output fell 2.0 pct to 293 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian crude oil production in 1996 fell two percent from 1995 to 293 million tonnes (around 5.86 million barrels per day), the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
